Pre-Anesthesia Evaluation: Airway assessment revealed a Mallampati score of Il. Cardiopulmonary examination was unremarkable. Patient confirmed NPO status since 10:00 PM the previous day, last clear fluids at 6:00 AM.

Planned Sedation: Moderate sedation planned using Midazolam 2 mg IV and Fentanyl 100 mcg IV. Anesthesia start time: 08:35 AM.

